  "prefilled_url": "https://github.com/huggingface/accelerate/compare/main...Afloat16:accelerate:perf/safetensors-fallback-membership-20261113?expand=1&title=Avoid%20quadratic%20name%20lookups%20when%20loading%20safetensors%20with%20CPU%20fallback&body=%23%23%20What%20does%20this%20PR%20do%3F%0A%0AThe%20mixed-device%20safetensors%20loader%20rebuilds%20the%20flattened%20list%20of%20assigned%20weight%20names%20for%20every%20checkpoint%20key%2C%20then%20performs%20a%20linear%20membership%20search.%20This%20makes%20the%20CPU-fallback%20name-selection%20phase%20quadratic%20in%20the%20number%20of%20weights%2C%20even%20for%20a%20device%20map%20with%20only%20two%20entries.%0A%0ABuild%20the%20assigned-name%20set%20once%2C%20append%20fallback%20names%20in%20their%20original%20order%2C%20and%20release%20the%20set%20before%20materializing%20tensors.%20Existing%20module-prefix%20assignment%2C%20overlapping%20entries%2C%20disk-to-CPU%20fallback%20and%20single-device%20fast%20paths%20retain%20their%20behavior.%0A%0A%23%23%20Measured%20loading%20improvement%0A%0A%5BSuccessful%20native%20before%2Fafter%20run%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAfloat16%2Faccelerate%2Factions%2Fruns%2F43415172502)%2C%20exact%20source%20%60d31250bad01c8fb0d3b0357a976721daa5dd63dd%60%2C%20upstream%20base%20%603bd795f7cfb763b994b4ba8ba59e5a305a7c528a%60.%0A%0AFull%20%60load_state_dict%60%20calls%20on%20real%20safetensors%20files%2C%20with%20half%20the%20keys%20assigned%20to%20CPU%20and%20half%20to%20disk.%20Medians%20of%20three%20warm-cache%20loads%20on%20the%20same%20GitHub-hosted%20CPU%20runner%3B%20normal%20progress%20rendering%20is%20retained%20and%20its%20stderr%20is%20redirected%20to%20the%20null%20device%20in%20both%20measurements.%0A%0A%7C%20Weights%20%7C%20Before%20%7C%20After%20%7C%20Speedup%20%7C%0A%7C%20---%20%7C%20---%3A%20%7C%20---%3A%20%7C%20---%3A%20%7C%0A%7C%2064%20%7C%205.876%20ms%20%7C%205.787%20ms%20%7C%201.02x%20%7C%0A%7C%204%2C096%20%7C%20242.194%20ms%20%7C%20177.454%20ms%20%7C%201.36x%2